00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:34.000
the hospitalizations are because of COVID
like a broken leg and they just have to accept

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.000
COVID or something.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
And that makes sense.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.760
But I remember in the beginning of the pandemic,
there were a bunch of right wingers making

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.890
the same argument to like, Oh, the hospitalizations
are overrated.

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.510
You know, they're they're pretending like
it's COVID when the person really died of

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.539
this and we were kind of discounting that
