00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:56.070
old shenanigans of just deflecting, you know,
finding any excuse to downplay the severity.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.149
So why is it now something that we're saying?

00:00:59.149 --> 00:01:03.190
Like, is there something specific about the
data that is showing us now that's really

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.190
